(THE GHANA STANDARDS AUTHORITY INFORMS THE) Tj T*
(GENERAL PUBLIC AND THE IMPORTING COMMUNITY IN) Tj T*
(PARTICULAR OF THE FOLLOWING ARRANGEMENTS) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(EFFECTIVE 1ST JANUARY 2019, a person who imports plugs and) Tj T*
(socket-outlets for household and similar purposes for use in Ghana) Tj T*
(shall ensure that:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(- The plugs comply with the Ghana Standard GS IEC 60884-2-1 -) Tj T*
(Plugs and socket-outlets for household and similar purposes; Part) Tj T*
(2-1: Particular Requirements for Fused Plugs.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(In addition, the Plugs should be type G. It shall be 13-amp plug) Tj T*
(with three rectangular prongs that form an isosceles triangle.) Tj T*
(The central earth pin is 4 by 8 mm and 22.7 mm long. Line and) Tj T*
(neutral pins are 4 by 6.35 mm and 17.7 mm long, on centres) Tj T*
(spaced 22.2 mm apart.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(- The socket outlets comply with the Ghana Standard GS IEC 60884-) Tj T*
(2-2 - Plugs and socket-outlets for household and similar purposes;) Tj T*
(Part 2-2: Particular Requirements for socket-outlets for appliances.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
